   </table><p style="text-indent:4.533%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">Income tax benefit increased less than $0.1 million, or 0.7%, for the three months ended June 30, 2026 from the three months ended June 30, 2025. We continued to record a valuation allowance on the use of deferred tax assets in the current and prior periods.</span><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:10pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;"> </span></p></div>
