   </table><p style="text-indent:2%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(1) In February 2026, our Board of Directors authorized a share repurchase program under which we may repurchase up to $30.0 million of our outstanding common stock. The program expires on December 31, 2027, or when the maximum authorized dollar amount has been utilized, whichever occurs first. The share repurchase program does not obligate us to make any repurchases and may be modified, suspended, or terminated by us at any time without prior notice.</span></p><p style="text-indent:2%;font-size:10pt;margin-top:6pt;font-family:Times New Roman;margin-bottom:0;text-align:left;"><span style="color:#000000;white-space:pre-wrap;font-size:9pt;font-family:Times New Roman;font-kerning:none;min-width:fit-content;">(2) The total number of shares purchased as part of the publicly announced program were all purchased pursuant to the February 2026 authorization.</span></p></div>
